<p>The list is flat on purpose. Sections come later, if the collection earns them.</p>

<h2>Plays</h2>
<ul>
  <li><a href="/playbooks/enabling-teams/agree-the-exit-signal-first/">Agree the exit signal before the first session</a></li>
  <li><a href="/playbooks/enabling-teams/hand-the-third-repeat-to-the-platform-team/">Hand the third repeat to the platform team</a></li>
  <li><a href="/playbooks/enabling-teams/decline-capacity-gaps/">Decline when the gap is capacity rather than capability</a></li>
  <li><a href="/playbooks/enabling-teams/run-an-inception/">Run an inception when the team can't state the problem the same way twice</a></li>
  <li><a href="/playbooks/enabling-teams/harvest-after-the-second-run/">Harvest a session into a module after its second run</a></li>
  <li><a href="/playbooks/enabling-teams/switch-to-dialogue/">Switch to dialogue when the same argument comes back a third time</a></li>
  <li><a href="/playbooks/enabling-teams/reflect-back-before-proposing/">Reflect back before proposing when a team rejects your first suggestion</a></li>
